s significantly decreased"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":680,"def":130,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"gravorobeast":{"slug":"gravorobeast","name":"Gravorobeast","icon":"/enemies-icons/Gravorobeast.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Basorobeast subspecies particular to certain regions. Regimens of knocking into cliff rock since infancy have honed their heads to exceptional sturdiness, able to shrug off fierce frontal attacks. Survival never ends, and the struggle never ceases.","abilities":["Weak spot located on its rear, damage dealt to the front is significantly decreased"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":16000,"atk":750,"def":160,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"maddened_vein_guardian":{"slug":"maddened_vein_guardian","name":"Maddened Vein Guardian","icon":"/enemies-icons/Maddened Vein Guardian.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Arts Creation","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A deformed Infected Creature often found wandering around ore veins. Guarding the mines has become an obsession of theirs, and they are willing to die for it.","abilities":["More likely to be attacked by friendly units; when attacked, inflicts a certain amount of Arts damage to the attacker"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":40000,"atk":500,"def":300,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"rainer_haribeast":{"slug":"rainer_haribeast","name":"Rainer Haribeast","icon":"/enemies-icons/Rainer Haribeast.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A variety of haribeast growing unusual thorns, which can be shot at speeds rivaling that of arrows. Minute barbs grow on the tips, leaving wounds that fail to heal long after the skin is broken. Once, someone announced they'd successfully tamed one of these creatures; afterwards, they were never seen again.","abilities":["Weak spot located on its front, damage dealt to the rear is decreased","Deals damage in a semicircle to the rear at every fixed portion of health lost"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":35000,"atk":720,"def":150,"res":8,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"pyric_originium_slug":{"slug":"pyric_originium_slug","name":"Pyric Originium Slug","icon":"/enemies-icons/Pyric Originium Slug.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Infected Creature","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A wild infected creature, the final stages of infection having led them to burn even hotter. Their fluids, hot as magma, melt even their own bodies. Once cooled, beautiful patterns can be found in the pools they leave behind.","abilities":["Attacks deal Burn"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":1800,"atk":80,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"leporibeast_longhorn":{"slug":"leporibeast_longhorn","name":"Leporibeast Longhorn","icon":"/enemies-icons/Leporibeast Longhorn.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Wild Beast","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"A herbivorous beast commonly found almost anywhere in the wild. It has grown large horns, but will still run away on reflex, jumping even higher and faster. The meat is very tender.","abilities":["After being attacked, runs away a random distance and rests for a period of time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpee